\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e[];\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e    \u003cspan class=\"kr\"\u003eprivate\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"nx\"\u003ereturnType\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"kt\"\u003eType\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e    \u003cspan class=\"kr\"\u003eprivate\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"nx\"\u003estaticFlag\u003c/span\u003e: \u003cspan class=\"kt\"\u003eboolean\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e}\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you combine \u003ccode\u003eClassSignature\u003c/code\u003e with \u003ccode\u003eMethodSubSignature\u003c/code\u003e then you would get the full method signature we mentioned above.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"the-entry-method-of-call-graph-construction\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#the-entry-method-of-call-graph-construction\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eThe entry method of Call Graph Construction\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe entry method of call graph generation is \u003ccode\u003emakeCallGraphCHA\u003c/code\u003e, whose parameters are a method signature array.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"code-block highlight is-open show-line-numbers  tw:group tw:my-2\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"\n    \n    tw:flex \n    tw:flex-row\n    tw:flex-1 \n    tw:justify-between \n    tw:w-full tw:bg-bgColor-secondary\n    \"\u003e      \n    \u003cbutton \n      class=\"\n        code-block-button\n        tw:mx-2 \n        tw:flex\n        tw:flex-row\n        tw:flex-1\"\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"tw:group