"\u003e**\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003ekwargs\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e        \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eend\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003etime\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003etime\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e()\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e        \u003cspan class=\"nb\"\u003eprint\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"sa\"\u003ef\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;Execute \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"si\"\u003e{\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003efunc\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"vm\"\u003e__name__\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"si\"\u003e}\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e in \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"si\"\u003e{\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eend\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e-\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003estart\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"si\"\u003e:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e.2f\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"si\"\u003e}\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e seconds\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e)\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e    \u003cspan class=\"k\"\u003ereturn\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003einner\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"nd\"\u003e@timeit\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"k\"\u003edef\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"nf\"\u003efoobar\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e():\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e    \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eans\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"mi\"\u003e0\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e    \u003cspan class=\"k\"\u003efor\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003ei\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"ow\"\u003ein\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"nb\"\u003erange\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mi\"\u003e10000000\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e):\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e        \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eans\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e+=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003ei\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e    \u003cspan class=\"k\"\u003ereturn\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eans\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003efoobar\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e()\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"wrap-up\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#wrap-up\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWrap-up\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThat\u0026rsquo;s all for this post. One thing I didn\u0026rsquo;t mention is that the Python decorator can also decorate a Python Class, because I barely use the object-oriented feature in Python. However, I do believe you could understand it by yourself if you could understand this post :)\u003c/p\u003e\n",
        "language": "en"
    },
    {
        "title" : "Reading Notes: Generalization through Memorization: Nearest Neighbor Language Models",
        "date_published" : "2024-12-23T22:01:35+08:00",
        "date_modified" : "2024-12-23T22:01:35+08:00",
        "id" : "https://martinlwx.github.io/en/what-is-knn-lm/",
        "url" : "https://martinlwx.github.io/en/what-is-knn-lm/",
        "summary": " MotivationA language solves 2 subproblems.\nMapping sentence prefixes to fixed-size representation. Using these representations to predict the next token in the context. The $k\\texttt{NN-LM}$ proposed in this hypothesis that representation learning problem may be easier than the prediction problem\nkNN-LMThe following graph demonstrates the idea behind the $k\\texttt{NN-LM}$ model.\nData PreparationTo use the $k\\texttt{NN-LM}$, we need to preprocess the documents in the corpus. The preprocessing procedure can be divided into some steps. Take the following sentence as an example.\n",
        "author" : {
          "name" : "MartinLwx"
        },
        "content_html" : "\u003ch2 id=\"motivation\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#motivation\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eMotivation\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eA language solves 2 subproblems.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMapping sentence prefixes to fixed-size representation.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUsing these representations to predict the next token in the context.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe $k\\texttt{NN-LM}$ proposed in this hypothesis that \u003cem\u003erepresentation learning problem may be easier than the prediction problem\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"knn-lm\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#knn-lm\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003ekNN-LM\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe following graph demonstrates the idea behind the $k\\texttt{NN-LM}$ model.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cfigure\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/img/knn-lm.png\" width=\"resize\"\u003e\n\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003ch3 id=\"data-preparation\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#data-preparation\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eData Preparation\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eTo use the $k\\texttt{NN-LM}$, we need to preprocess the documents in the corpus. The preprocessing procedure can be divided into some steps. Take the following sentence as an example.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"code-block highlight is-open show-line-numbers  tw:group tw:my-2\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"\n    \n    tw:flex \n    tw:flex-row\n    tw:flex-1 \n    tw:justify-between \n    tw:w-full tw:bg-bgColor-secondary\n    \"\u003e      \n    \u003cbutton \n      class=\"\n        code-block-button\n        tw:mx-2 \n        tw:flex\n        tw:flex-row\n        tw:flex-1\"\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"tw:group-[.is-open]:rotate-90 tw:transition-[transform] tw:duration-500 tw:ease-in-out tw:print:hidden! tw:w-min tw:h-min tw:my-1 tw:mx-1\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"icon