tton\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n  \u003cpre style=\"counter-reset: codeblock;\" class=\"tw:block tw:m-0 tw:p-0\"\u003e\u003ccode \n    id=\"codeblock-id-25\" \n    class=\"\n      chroma \n      tw:block! \n      tw:p-0\n      tw:m-0\n      tw:transition-[max-height] \n      tw:duration-500 \n      tw:ease-in-out \n      tw:group-[.is-closed]:max-h-0! \n      tw:group-[.is-wrap]:text-wrap\n      tw:overflow-y-hidden\n      tw:overflow-x-auto\n      tw:scrollbar-thin\n      \"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"k\"\u003edef\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"nf\"\u003eeffect\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e(\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"bp\"\u003eself\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eopponent_card\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eplayer\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eopponent\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e):\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e    \u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e\u0026#34;\u0026#34;\u0026#34;\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e    Swap the attack and defense of an opponent\u0026#39;s card.\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"s2\"\u003e    \u0026#34;\u0026#34;\u0026#34;\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"line\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cl\"\u003e    \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eopponent_card\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eattack\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eopponent_card\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003edefense\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e=\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eopponent_card\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003edefense\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"p\"\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e \u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eopponent_card\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"o\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"n\"\u003eattack\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch3 id=\"q9-the-instructor-arrives\" class=\"headerLink\"\u003e\n    \u003ca href=\"#q9-the-instructor-arrives\" class=\"header-mark\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eQ9: The Instructor Arrives\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003eA new challenger has appeared! Implement the \u003ccode\u003eeffect\u003c/code\u003e method for the Instructors, who add the opponent card\u0026rsquo;s attack and defense to all cards in the player\u0026rsquo;s deck and then removes \u003cem\u003eall\u003c/em\u003e cards in the opponent\u0026rsquo;s deck that have the same attack or defense as the opponent\u0026rsquo;s card.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003e\u003cem\u003eNote:\u003c/em\u003e If you mutate a list while iterating through it, you may run into trouble. Try iterating through a copy of the list instead. You can use slicing to make a copy of a list:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"code-block highlight is-open show-line-numbers  tw:group tw:my-2\"\u003e\n  \u003cdiv class=\"\n    \n    tw:flex \n    tw:flex-row\n    tw:flex-1 \n    tw:justify-between \n    tw:w-full tw:bg-bgColor-secondary\n    \"\u003e      \n    \u003cbutton \n      class=\"\n        code-block-button\n        tw:mx-2 \n        tw:flex\n        tw:flex-row\n        tw:flex-1\"\n      aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\n          \u003cspan class=\"tw:group-[.is-open]:rotate-90 tw